usage: modelmux login [-h] [--method METHOD] [--no-browser] [--raw] [--force]
                      {claude,codex}

positional arguments:
  {claude,codex}

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --method METHOD  login method (see the provider's options)
  --no-browser     do not open a browser
  --raw            show the provider's raw output
  --force          log in again even if logged in
